{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3000_place", "source_sha256": "61538fe10d0dd9651fd8c4d339439db3e5ef5b33795ac4e7527bd7039552a2df", "ja": "音楽スタジオ", "zh": "录音室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3001_035hin", "source_sha256": "10afcfad4e0c3c676818b9eda9e17525bde8c21ee7b56c42e1b700ada42b9baf", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}、あたし、\nやっぱり歌のお仕事が、いっちばん好きなんだわぁ。", "zh": "那个呀，{$P$}，\n我还是最喜欢唱歌的工作了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3002_035hin", "source_sha256": "d6e6e968ad9cb70ebc0902503305c5935ee197d680ea92f68d00c2a9a7da2fa8", "ja": "歌を聴いてくれた人に、もっとよろこんでもらうには、\nどんなことに気を付ければいいんだろか？", "zh": "为了让听我唱歌的所有人更加开心，\n要多注意什么地方才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3003", "source_sha256": "9332ceade2d134755c1090c32c4da401638b66c5b78117cd42041e8382cc6b40", "ja": "想いをこめる", "zh": "注入心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3004", "source_sha256": "fc4d4535a1ab45fe3dc198637c86fad71a5198b855762627b632982f3aef7202", "ja": "リズムを大事に", "zh": "重视节奏", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3100_p", "source_sha256": "0d9bf894d5452e8765380913bd7d080244d85e6e8a1c918acca4b07cde27922b", "ja": "一曲一曲に、\nひなたの想いをこめて歌うことじゃないかな。", "zh": "应该要在每一首歌中，\n都注入日向的心意来唱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3101_035hin", "source_sha256": "2fe5fc4af1117dfddf42968b7e0eb37151680e9ae0fa834c3a5b1c5cdbff2dd4", "ja": "歌に、あたしの想いをこめて……うん。\nそんならあたしにもできそうだべさ。", "zh": "在歌曲中注入我的心意……嗯，\n这我似乎也能办到哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3102_035hin", "source_sha256": "9a3fc34502790c5e3a741980fc6220189af3db4b8ffbabd910e2a80e812f0cd8", "ja": "えへへ、{$P$}、ありがとね。\nあたし、お客さんに届くように、がんばって歌うよお。", "zh": "嘿嘿，{$P$}，谢谢你了，\n我会努力唱歌，传达给听众的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3200_p", "source_sha256": "0d9bf894d5452e8765380913bd7d080244d85e6e8a1c918acca4b07cde27922b", "ja": "一曲一曲に、\nひなたの想いをこめて歌うことじゃないかな。", "zh": "应该要在每一首歌中，\n都注入日向的心意来唱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3201_035hin", "source_sha256": "a6a6d3a1932e2af3d4bddb8e4d216bc1cbb146194d094bca5cec9b4c545ec4f5", "ja": "そっかあ。気持ちって目に見えるもんでもないから、\nちょっこし難しいけんど……あたし、やってみるよお。", "zh": "这样啊，因为心情不是肉眼能看见的，\n有点困难……不过我会试试看喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3300_p", "source_sha256": "05008dc8f992042a1c95ca9e5e0fcd010a305f37248d356cda3e936ecf324bef", "ja": "リズムに気をつけて、\nていねいに歌うことかな。", "zh": "应该要重视节奏，\n细心唱歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3301_035hin", "source_sha256": "a8f722d16e999f63a6ff696f810bafa6900ffdeb0ed3ac10a240f7b0b13b5664", "ja": "うんうん、ちゃあんとリズムがとれてないと、\n気持ちよく聴けないもんなあ。", "zh": "嗯嗯，要是不抓好节奏的话，\n听起来就不悦耳了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3302_035hin", "source_sha256": "546cc5c96964443691bd988857177b498c3d47207a6642ec6f50823f601cb9db", "ja": "{$P$}、あたし、がんばるよお。\nしたっけ、あたしの歌、そこで聴いててねえ。", "zh": "{$P$}，我会加油～\n所以要听我唱歌喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3400_p", "source_sha256": "05008dc8f992042a1c95ca9e5e0fcd010a305f37248d356cda3e936ecf324bef", "ja": "リズムに気をつけて、\nていねいに歌うことかな。", "zh": "应该要重视节奏，\n细心唱歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_3401_035hin", "source_sha256": "9f1f6138a26517fc2e5fc8fb89b2f6b722949b15452d7e591000d81475c871af", "ja": "はや～、リズムかい？　あたし、リズムに遅れることが\n多いみたいでねえ。もっと、がんばらねば！", "zh": "哦～节奏吗？我似乎常常慢拍呢～\n得更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
